{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Clap your [Gm]hands, all you peo[Eb]ples
Shout to God [Bb]with loud songs of [F]joy
For the [Gm]Lord Most High is awe[Eb]some
[Bb]A great King over [F]all the earth
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Gm]God has gone [Eb]up with a [Bb]shout
The Lord with [F]the sound of a trumpet
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Gm]Sing praises [Eb]to God, sing praises
[Bb]Sing praises [F]to our King, sing praises
[Gm]For God is [Eb]the King of all [Bb]the [F]earth
Sing [Gm]praises
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Eb] | [Bb] | [F] | [Gm] | ×4
| [Eb] | [Bb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
He sub[Gm]dued peoples [Eb]under us
He [Bb]chose our heritage [F]for us
God [Gm]reigns over the na[Eb]tions
God sits [Bb]on his holy [F]throne
{end_of_verse}

